{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ThePackingEditApp 是一款為旅客而設的打包與穿搭規劃工具，能建立膠囊衣櫥、按日編排造型，並依目的地、天數與活動生成智能打包清單。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-156.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能打包與穿搭規劃</h2>\n<p>可依目的地、天數與活動生成個人化打包清單，並以視覺化格狀系統建立膠囊衣櫥；內建旅程日曆可逐日編排造型，集中保存多個旅程與衣櫥。加入衣物時支援 AI 辨識或手動上載，亦可參考社群靈感，打包時可編輯、調整與勾選項目，適合商務出差、度假及家庭旅行。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-615-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-616-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-617-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-618-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ThePackingEditApp</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/thepackingeditapp/id6759020380?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.531888+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T02:43:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:39.077718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:39.077718+00:00","content_hash":"8714c760d56a24b0f52f36c4fe2afe33158fbdc54662dd583faf6019759d543e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}